WEBVTT

00:03:59.746 --> 00:04:02.746
its second and last
growth spurt in your 20s

00:04:02.770 --> 00:04:05.616
as it rewires itself for adulthood,

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:09.693
which means that whatever it is you want
to change about yourself,

00:04:09.717 --> 00:04:11.724
now is the time to change it.

00:04:12.536 --> 00:04:15.758
We know that personality
changes more during your 20s

00:04:15.782 --> 00:04:18.464
than at any other time in life,

00:04:18.488 --> 00:04:22.330
and we know that female fertility
peaks at age 28,

00:04:22.354 --> 00:04:25.526
and things get tricky after age 35.

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:28.838
So your 20s are the time
to educate yourself

00:04:28.862 --> 00:04:31.853
about your body and your options.